# Rezbit rez5, big bodies: tools/cov/specs/rezbit_force3.py (REZ5_GROUPS=think,queues) arms gdb queues at the first live
# Think, then the commands below drive them: send (AcceptScriptMsg), uevent (DoUserAnimEvent / StartVirusAttack),
# trigcall (ShouldVirusAttack), shoot + obj (obj is the trigger of the DeflectMissiles direct calls).
@f300 god 1
@f310 layer 3
@f450 layer 4
@f520 place e0005011b player 15
